@startuml Sequence_IDE_Run
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
}

title Sequence Diagram: Luong chay thu IDE Run (ALOJ moi)

actor "Browser\n(IDE Page)" as B
participant "Django Site\n(RunSubmitView)" as Site
database "MariaDB" as DB
participant "Bridge\n:9998" as Bridge
participant "Judge Server\n:9999" as Judge
participant "WSEvent\n(Node.js)" as WS

== 1. User viet code va bam Run ==
B -> Site : POST /problem/<code>/run\n{source, language, custom_inputs[]}

== 2. Validate ==
Site -> Site : Kiem tra:\n- enable_new_ide == True\n- User co quyen truy cap\n- Rate limit (pending < LIMIT)\n- Source length <= 8192\n- Language hop le\n- Custom inputs <= 3, moi cai <= limit

Site -> DB : SELECT ProblemTestCase\nWHERE is_sample=True, type='C'
DB --> Site : sample_test_cases[]

== 3. Tao RunSubmission ==
Site -> DB : INSERT RunSubmission\n(status='QU', source=inline)

Site -> Bridge : TCP :9998\n**run-request**\n{submission-id, problem-id,\nlanguage, source,\nsample-input-files,\ncustom-inputs}

Bridge --> Site : run-received\n{id}
Site --> B : JSON {run_id, id_secret}

== 4. Browser subscribe WebSocket ==
B -> WS : Subscribe channel\n**run_<id_secret>**

== 5. Bridge chuyen den Judge ==
Bridge -> Judge : TCP :9999\nsubmission-request + meta:\n{sample-testcase-only: true,\nsample-input-files: [...],\ncustom-inputs: [...]}

== 6. Judge chi chay sample tests + custom ==
Judge -> Judge : Bien dich source

Judge --> Bridge : submission-processing
Bridge -> DB : UPDATE RunSubmission status='P'

Judge --> Bridge : grading-begin
Bridge -> DB : UPDATE RunSubmission status='G'

loop Chi sample tests + custom inputs
  Judge -> Judge : Chay test case
  Judge --> Bridge : test-case-status\n{case, status, time, memory}
  Bridge -> Bridge : Tich luy vao\n_run_test_cases[] list
  note right of Bridge : KHONG tao\nSubmissionTestCase
  Bridge -> WS : POST :15101\nevent run_<id_secret>
  WS -> B : WebSocket\n{case result}
  note right of B : Hien thi ket qua\ntung test tren IDE
end

Judge --> Bridge : grading-end

== 7. Luu ket qua ==
Bridge -> DB : UPDATE RunSubmission\nstatus='D', result='AC/WA/...'\ncase_results=JSON[...]

Bridge -> WS : POST :15101\n{type: grading-end}
WS -> B : WebSocket\n{final result}

note right of B
  Ket qua hien thi tren IDE panel
  **Khong luu vao Submission**
  **Khong anh huong diem/ranking**
end note

note over B, WS
  Fallback: Neu WebSocket khong kha dung,
  Browser poll GET /run/poll/<run_id>
end note

@enduml
